{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14739","headline":"送张调参军侍从归觐荆南因寄长林司空十四曙 · 卢纶","name":"送张调参军侍从归觐荆南因寄长林司空十四曙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉勒侍行襜，郄超未有髯。\n守儒轻猎骑，承诲访沈潜。\n云势将峰杂，江声与屿兼。\n还当见王粲，应念二毛添。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}